{%- render 'vaidyam-font' -%}
{{ 'vaidyam-landing.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<div class="vaidyam-static-page">
  <div class="page-width vaidyam-container">
    <div class="vaidyam-static-header">
      <p class="vaidyam-eyebrow">AUTHOR INSTRUCTIONS · PEER REVIEW</p>
      <h1 class="vaidyam-static-title">Submission Guidelines &amp; Policies</h1>
      <p class="vaidyam-static-lead">Kerala Ayurveda VAIDYAM invites contributions from academicians, researchers, clinicians, and students in Ayurveda and allied sciences.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="vaidyam-static-content">
      
      <div class="vaidyam-static-section">
        <h2>1. Introduction &amp; Publishing Ethics</h2>
        <p>Kerala Ayurveda VAIDYAM is an English quarterly magazine, available both in print and digital, covering topics in Ayurveda and healthcare. It caters to the student and practitioner community of Ayurveda and aims to give readers a productive reading experience that will enhance their understanding and practice of the system. Vaidyam has been in publication since 2003 by Kerala Ayurveda Limited, a full-spectrum Ayurveda company with a legacy of over 80 years. Thousands of copies of Vaidyam are distributed globally.</p>
        <p>We invite contributions from a varied group of authors, including academicians, researchers, clinicians, and students. We uphold high academic rigor and ethical publishing standards, ensuring that all articles contribute meaningfully to the discourse on Ayurveda.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="vaidyam-static-section">
        <h2>2. Target Readers</h2>
        <div class="vaidyam-guidelines-readers">
          <div class="vaidyam-reader-box">
            <strong>Professionals</strong>
            <span>Clinicians, academic faculty, researchers, formulation scientists, and hospital administrators.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="vaidyam-reader-box">
            <strong>Students</strong>
            <span>BAMS scholars, MD/MS postgraduate researchers, and students of allied life sciences and healthcare streams.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="vaidyam-static-section">
        <h2>3. Commonly Accepted Manuscript Categories</h2>
        <div class="vaidyam-categories-list">
          
          <div class="vaidyam-cat-item">
            <div class="vaidyam-cat-header">
              <h4>Review Articles</h4>
              <span class="vaidyam-word-count">Under 1,500 words</span>
            </div>
            <p>Comprehensive, referenced overviews of Ayurvedic concepts, interpretations, ingredients such as herbs, classical formulations, diet, lifestyle, yoga, and clinical research updates.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="vaidyam-cat-item">
            <div class="vaidyam-cat-header">
              <h4>Practitioner Section (Clinical Case Reports)</h4>
              <span class="vaidyam-word-count">Under 1,500 words</span>
            </div>
            <p>Well-documented case reports prepared strictly in the international CARE format, highlighting diagnostic reasoning, therapeutic interventions, and clinical outcomes.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="vaidyam-cat-item">
            <div class="vaidyam-cat-header">
              <h4>Student Section</h4>
              <span class="vaidyam-word-count">Under 800 words</span>
            </div>
            <p>Short essays, clinical reflections, campus stories of relevance, innovative ideas, and novel pedagogical concepts from Ayurveda students.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="vaidyam-cat-item">
            <div class="vaidyam-cat-header">
              <h4>Reviews of Books, Apps &amp; Equipment</h4>
              <span class="vaidyam-word-count">Under 800 words</span>
            </div>
            <p>Critical reviews of published academic works, healthcare software/mobile apps, or biomedical equipment supporting Ayurvedic clinical diagnostics and therapy.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="vaidyam-cat-item">
            <div class="vaidyam-cat-header">
              <h4>Letter to the Editor</h4>
              <span class="vaidyam-word-count">Under 200 words</span>
            </div>
            <p>Brief communications regarding recently published articles, constructive critiques, or focused commentary on relevant topics in Ayurveda.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="vaidyam-static-section">
        <h2>4. Formatting &amp; Editorial Style</h2>
        <div class="vaidyam-style-rules">
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Language &amp; Tonality:</strong> English (U.S.). Informative, scholarly tone suitable for knowledgeable readers in neutral formality with minimal jargon.</li>
            <li><strong>Sanskrit Transliteration:</strong> Use IAST (International Alphabet of Sanskrit Transliteration). Italicize Sanskrit terms (e.g., <em>doṣa</em>) except proper nouns (e.g., <em>Caraka Saṃhitā</em>).</li>
            <li><strong>Ingredient Nomenclature:</strong> Primary name in Sanskrit/regional language and scientific binomial name in italics, e.g., <em>balā</em> (<em><strong>Sida</strong> cordifolia</em>). Common culinary ingredients may use standard English names (e.g., turmeric).</li>
            <li><strong>Citations &amp; References:</strong> Vancouver citation style. A minimum of 5 authentic references is required for scholarly and review articles.</li>
            <li><strong>Figures &amp; Infographics:</strong> Submit high-resolution figures (minimum 300 DPI) with descriptive captions and proper copyright attribution.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="vaidyam-submission-box">
        <h3>Submit Your Manuscript</h3>
        <p>Email your manuscript in Microsoft Word or Google Docs format to the editorial office:</p>
        <a href="mailto:vaidyam@keralaayurveda.biz?subject=Manuscript%20Submission%20-%20Vaidyam%20Magazine" class="vaidyam-btn vaidyam-btn--primary vaidyam-btn--lg">Email: vaidyam@keralaayurveda.biz &rarr;</a>
        <p class="vaidyam-sub-note">Shortlisted authors will receive a notification to submit author biography and high-resolution portrait photograph.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.vaidyam-guidelines-readers {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 16px;
}
.vaidyam-reader-box {
  background: #FBF9F5;
  border: 1px solid #ECE7DB;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 20px 24px;
}
.vaidyam-reader-box strong {
  display: block;
  font-family: 'Amstir', Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 18px;
  color: #1B4332;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.vaidyam-reader-box span {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #555;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.vaidyam-categories-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 16px;
}
.vaidyam-cat-item {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border: 1px solid #EAE5D9;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 20px 24px;
}
.vaidyam-cat-header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: baseline;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.vaidyam-cat-header h4 {
  font-family: 'Amstir', Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #1B4332;
  margin: 0;
}
.vaidyam-word-count {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #2D6A4F;
  background: #E8F2EC;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  border-radius: 4px;
}
.vaidyam-cat-item p {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #555;
  line-height: 1.55;
  margin: 0;
}
.vaidyam-style-rules ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
}
.vaidyam-style-rules li {
  position: relative;
  padding-left: 24px;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: #444;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.vaidyam-style-rules li::before {
  content: "✔";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  color: #2D6A4F;
  font-size: 14px;
}
.vaidyam-submission-box {
  background: #F4F8F5;
  border: 2px dashed #2D6A4F;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 40px;
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 48px;
}
.vaidyam-submission-box h3 {
  font-family: 'Amstir', Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 26px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #1B4332;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.vaidyam-submission-box p {
  font-size: 16px;
  color: #444;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.vaidyam-sub-note {
  font-size: 13px !important;
  color: #777 !important;
  font-style: italic;
  margin-top: 16px !important;
  margin-bottom: 0 !important;
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .vaidyam-guidelines-readers {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Submission Guidelines",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
